(FIL-18: element <index> of <list> takes a variable or a grouped expression as its index - LANGUAGE.md:3905-3906.
 Three rendered shapes of 'gen leaf list computed index': a grouped
 {base add offset} index, a plain variable, and a variable corrected by a
 runtime Set. Also hand-verified: the ungrouped
 'element base add 1 of' does not parse (Expected 'of' after element index).
 Run from the vox-fuzz worktree root; the probe creates everything it
 needs under vf_scratch/files/ and touches nothing else.
